{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-4778","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4873","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4874","text":": Spatial Intelligence for Agents"}]},{"id":"blk-4779","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4875","text":"The "},{"id":"spn-4876","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4877","text":" capability family represents an agent's ability to reason about "},{"id":"spn-4878","marks":["bold"],"text":"where things are, how they move, how regions relate to one another, and what actions are valid in a spatial context"},{"id":"spn-4879","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-4780","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4880","text":"In the [&] Protocol, "},{"id":"spn-4881","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4882","text":" is one of the four core cognitive primitives (alongside "},{"id":"spn-4883","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-4884","text":" the sensorimotor primitive and "},{"id":"spn-4885","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-4886","text":" the cross-cutting operational primitive):"}]},{"id":"blk-4781","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4783","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4887","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-4888","text":" — what the agent knows"}]}],"id":"blk-4782","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4785","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4889","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-4890","text":" — how the agent decides"}]}],"id":"blk-4784","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4787","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4891","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-4892","text":" — when things happen"}]}],"id":"blk-4786","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4789","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4893","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4894","text":" — where things are"}]}],"id":"blk-4788","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4791","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4895","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-4896","text":" — how the agent is instantiated in an environment (perception, action, affordance)"}]}],"id":"blk-4790","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4793","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4897","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-4898","text":" — who is acting, under what rules, at what cost"}]}],"id":"blk-4792","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4794","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4899","text":"Spatial capability matters whenever an agent operates over fleets, maps, routes, regions, geofences, topologies, facilities, service territories, supply chains, or any system where location and position change what a valid decision looks like."}]},{"id":"blk-4795","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4900","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4901","text":" is distinct from "},{"id":"spn-4902","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-4903","text":": "},{"id":"spn-4904","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4905","text":" models external spatial data (fleet positions, regions, routes), while "},{"id":"spn-4906","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-4907","text":" models the agent's own sensorimotor interface to an environment (perception, typed action, affordance enumeration). An agent may consume "},{"id":"spn-4908","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-4909","text":" to reason about where vehicles are AND declare "},{"id":"spn-4910","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.motor"},{"id":"spn-4911","text":" to actuate one."}]},{"id":"blk-4796","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4912","text":"Why "},{"id":"spn-4913","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4914","text":" exists as a first-class primitive"}]},{"id":"blk-4797","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4915","text":"A large number of agents fail in subtle ways because they treat the world as if it were only text plus tools."}]},{"id":"blk-4798","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4916","text":"That is often enough for toy demos, but it breaks down quickly in real systems."}]},{"id":"blk-4799","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4917","text":"A support agent may need to know which warehouse serves a customer. A fleet agent may need to know which vehicles are inside a region. An infrastructure agent may need to know which datacenter cluster is affected by an incident. A delivery agent may need to know whether a route crosses a restricted area. A security or compliance agent may need to know whether data or assets entered a prohibited zone."}]},{"id":"blk-4800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4918","text":"Those are not just \"tool calls.\" They are spatial questions."}]},{"id":"blk-4801","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4919","text":"Treating spatial intelligence as a first-class capability allows the protocol to express:"}]},{"id":"blk-4802","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4804","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4920","text":"that an agent has spatial awareness at all"}]}],"id":"blk-4803","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4806","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4921","text":"what kind of spatial awareness it has"}]}],"id":"blk-4805","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4808","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4922","text":"which provider implements it"}]}],"id":"blk-4807","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4923","text":"how it composes with memory, time, and reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-4809","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4924","text":"what types it accepts and produces in a pipeline"}]}],"id":"blk-4811","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4813","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4925","text":"Without "},{"id":"spn-4926","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4927","text":", spatial reasoning tends to be hidden inside ad hoc prompt logic or application-specific glue code. The result is architecture that looks plausible but is difficult to validate, govern, or reuse."}]},{"id":"blk-4814","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4928","text":"What "},{"id":"spn-4929","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4930","text":" means in the protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-4815","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4931","text":"At the protocol level, "},{"id":"spn-4932","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4933","text":" is not a vendor, map service, or database."}]},{"id":"blk-4816","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4934","text":"It is a "},{"id":"spn-4935","marks":["bold"],"text":"capability interface"},{"id":"spn-4936","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-4817","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4937","text":"That means:"}]},{"id":"blk-4818","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4820","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4938","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-4939","text":" is a protocol capability"}]}],"id":"blk-4819","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4822","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4940","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic"},{"id":"spn-4941","text":" is one provider that may satisfy it"}]}],"id":"blk-4821","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4942","text":"another provider could also satisfy "},{"id":"spn-4943","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-4944","text":" if it implements the same contract"}]}],"id":"blk-4823","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4825","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4945","text":"This separation is important."}]},{"id":"blk-4826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4946","text":"If spatial intelligence were modeled only as provider names, then architecture would collapse into product branding. By modeling "},{"id":"spn-4947","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4948","text":" as an interface family, the protocol stays portable."}]},{"id":"blk-4827","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4949","text":"Common "},{"id":"spn-4950","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4951","text":" subtypes"}]},{"id":"blk-4828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4952","text":"The current protocol direction suggests several useful subtype patterns."}]},{"id":"blk-4829","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4953","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]},{"id":"blk-4830","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4954","text":"Represents awareness of distributed assets, vehicles, units, nodes, or regions as a coordinated fleet-like system."}]},{"id":"blk-4831","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4955","text":"Typical concerns:"}]},{"id":"blk-4832","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4834","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4956","text":"region occupancy"}]}],"id":"blk-4833","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4836","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4957","text":"asset distribution"}]}],"id":"blk-4835","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4838","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4958","text":"nearest available unit"}]}],"id":"blk-4837","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4840","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4959","text":"affected-region lookup"}]}],"id":"blk-4839","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4842","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4960","text":"current fleet state"}]}],"id":"blk-4841","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4844","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4961","text":"capacity by territory"}]}],"id":"blk-4843","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4845","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4962","text":"This is the subtype most relevant to logistics, dispatch, field operations, and infrastructure regions."}]},{"id":"blk-4846","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4963","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.route"}]},{"id":"blk-4847","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4964","text":"Represents route computation, path constraints, spatial transitions, and route optimization."}]},{"id":"blk-4848","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4965","text":"Typical concerns:"}]},{"id":"blk-4849","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4851","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4966","text":"shortest or cheapest path"}]}],"id":"blk-4850","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4853","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4967","text":"route feasibility"}]}],"id":"blk-4852","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4968","text":"route recomputation"}]}],"id":"blk-4854","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4857","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4969","text":"path explanation"}]}],"id":"blk-4856","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4859","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4970","text":"route impact under changing conditions"}]}],"id":"blk-4858","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4860","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4971","text":"This subtype matters when sequence through space is more important than current static position."}]},{"id":"blk-4861","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4972","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.geofence"}]},{"id":"blk-4862","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4973","text":"Represents boundary-aware spatial logic."}]},{"id":"blk-4863","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4974","text":"Typical concerns:"}]},{"id":"blk-4864","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4866","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4975","text":"enter/exit events"}]}],"id":"blk-4865","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4868","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4976","text":"restricted zones"}]}],"id":"blk-4867","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4870","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4977","text":"compliance zones"}]}],"id":"blk-4869","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4978","text":"operating boundaries"}]}],"id":"blk-4871","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4874","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4979","text":"service areas"}]}],"id":"blk-4873","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4980","text":"event-triggered actions based on region membership"}]}],"id":"blk-4875","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4981","text":"This subtype is useful whenever boundary conditions affect policy or action."}]},{"id":"blk-4878","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4982","text":"Future subtype candidates"}]},{"id":"blk-4879","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4983","text":"As the protocol evolves, additional spatial subtypes may emerge, for example:"}]},{"id":"blk-4880","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4882","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4984","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.topology"}]}],"id":"blk-4881","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4985","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.facility"}]}],"id":"blk-4883","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4886","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4986","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.coverage"}]}],"id":"blk-4885","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4987","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.territory"}]}],"id":"blk-4887","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4889","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4988","text":"The protocol should stay conservative at the primitive level and extensible at the subtype level."}]},{"id":"blk-4890","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-4989","text":"What problems "},{"id":"spn-4990","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4991","text":" solves"}]},{"id":"blk-4891","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4992","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-4993","text":" gives the protocol a standard place to express capabilities like:"}]},{"id":"blk-4892","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4894","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4994","text":"finding where an event occurred"}]}],"id":"blk-4893","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4896","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4995","text":"mapping impact to regions or zones"}]}],"id":"blk-4895","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4898","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4996","text":"connecting a decision to real-world or logical geography"}]}],"id":"blk-4897","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4900","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4997","text":"constraining actions by allowed locations"}]}],"id":"blk-4899","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4998","text":"ranking options by distance, route cost, or region state"}]}],"id":"blk-4901","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4904","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-4999","text":"enriching a decision with local spatial context"}]}],"id":"blk-4903","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4905","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5000","text":"These are especially important when spatial context changes the meaning of the same underlying event."}]},{"id":"blk-4906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5001","text":"Example:"}]},{"id":"blk-4907","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5002","text":"An anomaly in CPU usage means something very different if it affects:"}]},{"id":"blk-4908","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5003","text":"one isolated test node"}]}],"id":"blk-4909","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5004","text":"every production node in "},{"id":"spn-5005","marks":["code"],"text":"us-east"}]}],"id":"blk-4911","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5006","text":"a route-optimization cluster near a major logistics hub"}]}],"id":"blk-4913","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5007","text":"a restricted compliance boundary"}]}],"id":"blk-4915","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4917","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5008","text":"The anomaly itself may be temporal. The business meaning often becomes spatial."}]},{"id":"blk-4918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5009","text":"That is why "},{"id":"spn-5010","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5011","text":" composes naturally with "},{"id":"spn-5012","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-5013","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-4919","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5014","text":"Cognitive role of "},{"id":"spn-5015","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-4920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5016","text":"A useful way to think about the four primitives is:"}]},{"id":"blk-4921","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4923","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5017","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-5018","text":" stores and recalls prior structure"}]}],"id":"blk-4922","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5019","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-5020","text":" evaluates and decides"}]}],"id":"blk-4924","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4927","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5021","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-5022","text":" models change and sequence"}]}],"id":"blk-4926","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4929","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5023","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5024","text":" localizes state and action"}]}],"id":"blk-4928","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5025","text":"In practice, "},{"id":"spn-5026","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5027","text":" helps answer:"}]},{"id":"blk-4931","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4933","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5028","text":"Where is this happening?"}]}],"id":"blk-4932","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4935","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5029","text":"What else is nearby or inside the same boundary?"}]}],"id":"blk-4934","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4937","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5030","text":"What region, route, zone, or topology is affected?"}]}],"id":"blk-4936","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4939","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5031","text":"What actions are allowed in this location?"}]}],"id":"blk-4938","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5032","text":"How does location change priority or response?"}]}],"id":"blk-4940","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4942","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5033","text":"This makes "},{"id":"spn-5034","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5035","text":" an essential primitive for situated agents."}]},{"id":"blk-4943","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5036","text":"Typical providers"}]},{"id":"blk-4944","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5037","text":"The protocol does not require one provider, but a few provider patterns are common."}]},{"id":"blk-4945","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5038","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic"}]},{"id":"blk-4946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5039","text":"A natural example provider for "},{"id":"spn-5040","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-5041","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-4947","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5042","text":"This kind of provider may expose:"}]},{"id":"blk-4948","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5043","text":"region state"}]}],"id":"blk-4949","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4952","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5044","text":"fleet distribution"}]}],"id":"blk-4951","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5045","text":"geofencing"}]}],"id":"blk-4953","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5046","text":"location enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-4955","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5047","text":"affected-region queries"}]}],"id":"blk-4957","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4959","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5048","text":"GIS and geospatial databases"}]},{"id":"blk-4960","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5049","text":"A geospatial database or service can satisfy parts of "},{"id":"spn-5050","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5051","text":" if it exposes the right contract."}]},{"id":"blk-4961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5052","text":"Examples might include systems built around:"}]},{"id":"blk-4962","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4964","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5053","text":"PostGIS"}]}],"id":"blk-4963","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4966","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5054","text":"custom geospatial indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-4965","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4968","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5055","text":"spatial event stores"}]}],"id":"blk-4967","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4970","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5056","text":"topology services"}]}],"id":"blk-4969","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4971","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5057","text":"Routing engines"}]},{"id":"blk-4972","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5058","text":"A routing engine may satisfy parts of "},{"id":"spn-5059","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.route"},{"id":"spn-5060","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-4973","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5061","text":"What matters is not the brand name, but whether the implementation satisfies the protocol contract for that subtype."}]},{"id":"blk-4974","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5062","text":"Custom domain-specific spatial systems"}]},{"id":"blk-4975","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5063","text":"A warehouse graph, datacenter topology model, maritime route service, or airspace constraint system could all act as "},{"id":"spn-5064","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5065","text":" providers if they are wrapped behind the expected capability surface."}]},{"id":"blk-4976","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5066","text":"Example declaration"}]},{"id":"blk-4977","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5067","text":"A simple spatial capability declaration in "},{"id":"spn-5068","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-5069","text":" might look like this:"}]},{"id":"blk-4978","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5070","text":"{ \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"FleetManager\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&space.fleet\": { \"provider\": \"geofleetic\", \"config\": { \"regions\": [\"us-east\", \"us-central\"], \"mode\": \"regional-capacity-awareness\" } } }, \"provenance\": true }"}]},{"id":"blk-4979","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5071","text":"A goal-driven variant might use auto-resolution:"}]},{"id":"blk-4980","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5072","text":"{ \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"RouteCoordinator\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&space.route\": { \"provider\": \"auto\", \"need\": \"regional route optimization with compliance boundaries\" } }, \"governance\": { \"infer_from_goal\": true }, \"provenance\": true }"}]},{"id":"blk-4981","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5073","text":"Example contract shape"}]},{"id":"blk-4982","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5074","text":"A capability contract for "},{"id":"spn-5075","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-5076","text":" might express operations like these:"}]},{"id":"blk-4983","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5077","text":"{ \"capability\": \"&space.fleet\", \"operations\": { \"locate\": { \"in\": \"asset_query\", \"out\": \"location_set\" }, \"enrich\": { \"in\": \"context\", \"out\": \"spatial_context\" }, \"capacity\": { \"in\": \"region_query\", \"out\": \"capacity_snapshot\" } }, \"accepts_from\": [\"&time.*\", \"&memory.*\", \"raw_data\"], \"feeds_into\": [\"&reason.*\", \"&memory.*\", \"output\"], \"a2a_skills\": [\"fleet-state-enrichment\", \"regional-capacity-lookup\"] }"}]},{"id":"blk-4984","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5078","text":"The point is not that every provider must use exactly these names."}]},{"id":"blk-4985","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5079","text":"The point is that spatial capability should expose:"}]},{"id":"blk-4986","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4988","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5080","text":"explicit operations"}]}],"id":"blk-4987","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4990","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5081","text":"explicit input/output types"}]}],"id":"blk-4989","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-4992","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5082","text":"explicit compatibility boundaries"}]}],"id":"blk-4991","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-4993","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5083","text":"That is what makes composition validateable."}]},{"id":"blk-4994","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5084","text":"Example pipelines involving "},{"id":"spn-5085","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-4995","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5086","text":"Temporal event localized spatially"}]},{"id":"blk-4996","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5087","text":"A common flow is:"}]},{"id":"blk-4997","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5088","text":"stream_data"}]},{"id":"blk-4998","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5089","text":"Interpretation:"}]},{"id":"blk-4999","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5001","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5090","text":"detect anomalies"}]}],"id":"blk-5000","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5003","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5091","text":"map those anomalies to affected regions or assets"}]}],"id":"blk-5002","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5005","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5092","text":"reason over the enriched operational context"}]}],"id":"blk-5004","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-5006","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5093","text":"Memory + spatial context"}]},{"id":"blk-5007","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5094","text":"Another common pattern is:"}]},{"id":"blk-5008","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5095","text":"incident_context"}]},{"id":"blk-5009","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5096","text":"Interpretation:"}]},{"id":"blk-5010","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5097","text":"retrieve similar prior incidents"}]}],"id":"blk-5011","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5098","text":"determine whether current assets or actions intersect constrained zones"}]}],"id":"blk-5013","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5016","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5099","text":"reason under both historical and spatial constraints"}]}],"id":"blk-5015","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-5017","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5100","text":"Route-aware planning"}]},{"id":"blk-5018","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5101","text":"A route-sensitive planning flow may look like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5019","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5102","text":"delivery_request"}]},{"id":"blk-5020","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5103","text":"Interpretation:"}]},{"id":"blk-5021","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5104","text":"produce route options or route context"}]}],"id":"blk-5022","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5025","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5105","text":"enrich with temporal expectation such as demand or congestion window"}]}],"id":"blk-5024","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5027","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5106","text":"select or evaluate a plan"}]}],"id":"blk-5026","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-5028","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5107","text":"How "},{"id":"spn-5108","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5109","text":" composes with the other primitives"}]},{"id":"blk-5029","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5110","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5111","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-5112","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"}]},{"id":"blk-5030","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5113","text":"Memory helps answer what happened before. Space helps answer where it is happening now."}]},{"id":"blk-5031","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5114","text":"Together they support questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5032","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5115","text":"Have we seen incidents like this in this region?"}]}],"id":"blk-5033","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5036","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5116","text":"Which routes historically fail under these conditions?"}]}],"id":"blk-5035","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5038","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5117","text":"Which service zones tend to exceed capacity after similar events?"}]}],"id":"blk-5037","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5118","text":"This pairing is especially strong for historical localization."}]},{"id":"blk-5040","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5119","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5120","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-5121","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"}]},{"id":"blk-5041","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5122","text":"Time detects sequence, trend, anomaly, or forecast. Space localizes the effect."}]},{"id":"blk-5042","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5123","text":"Together they support questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5043","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5045","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5124","text":"Which region is drifting toward overload?"}]}],"id":"blk-5044","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5047","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5125","text":"Where are anomalies clustering over time?"}]}],"id":"blk-5046","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5049","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5126","text":"Which route becomes invalid during a forecasted demand spike?"}]}],"id":"blk-5048","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5050","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5127","text":"This pairing is essential for operational and logistics agents."}]},{"id":"blk-5051","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5128","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5129","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-5130","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"}]},{"id":"blk-5052","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5131","text":"Spatial context often changes which decisions are acceptable."}]},{"id":"blk-5053","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5132","text":"Reasoning without spatial awareness can choose actions that are technically coherent but operationally invalid."}]},{"id":"blk-5054","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5133","text":"Together they support questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5055","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5057","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5134","text":"Is scaling in this region allowed under policy?"}]}],"id":"blk-5056","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5059","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5135","text":"Which region should receive rerouted capacity?"}]}],"id":"blk-5058","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5061","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5136","text":"Which route balances service level and compliance risk?"}]}],"id":"blk-5060","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5062","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5137","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5138","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-5139","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-5140","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-5141","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-5142","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-5143","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"}]},{"id":"blk-5063","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5144","text":"This is the full composition story for many real systems:"}]},{"id":"blk-5064","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5066","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5145","text":"memory gives history"}]}],"id":"blk-5065","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5068","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5146","text":"time gives dynamics"}]}],"id":"blk-5067","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5070","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5147","text":"space gives localization"}]}],"id":"blk-5069","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5072","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5148","text":"reason gives decision logic"}]}],"id":"blk-5071","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5073","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5149","text":"That combination is why the protocol models all four primitives rather than reducing everything to one generic intelligence bucket."}]},{"id":"blk-5074","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5150","text":"Governance implications of "},{"id":"spn-5151","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-5075","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5152","text":"Spatial systems often have strong governance requirements."}]},{"id":"blk-5076","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5153","text":"Examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-5077","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5079","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5154","text":"never route assets through a restricted zone"}]}],"id":"blk-5078","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5081","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5155","text":"never expose private location data outside authorized context"}]}],"id":"blk-5080","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5083","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5156","text":"always escalate when operations cross a jurisdictional boundary"}]}],"id":"blk-5082","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5085","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5157","text":"prefer routes that remain inside approved service areas"}]}],"id":"blk-5084","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5087","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5158","text":"prefer region-local action over cross-region action when confidence is low"}]}],"id":"blk-5086","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5088","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5159","text":"This makes "},{"id":"spn-5160","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5161","text":" especially relevant to declarative governance."}]},{"id":"blk-5089","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5162","text":"A governance block might include rules like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5090","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5163","text":"{ \"governance\": { \"hard\": [ \"Never route assets through restricted geofences\", \"Never disclose customer or fleet location outside authorized workflows\" ], \"soft\": [ \"Prefer local-region remediation before cross-region failover\" ], \"escalate_when\": { \"hard_boundary_approached\": true, \"confidence_below\": 0.75 } } }"}]},{"id":"blk-5091","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5164","text":"The protocol's value here is that spatial constraints become portable data, not hidden application logic."}]},{"id":"blk-5092","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5165","text":"Provenance implications of "},{"id":"spn-5166","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-5093","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5167","text":"Spatial enrichment should be provenance-aware."}]},{"id":"blk-5094","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5168","text":"If an agent reasons over spatial context, a provenance chain should preserve facts like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5095","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5097","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5169","text":"which spatial capability produced the region mapping"}]}],"id":"blk-5096","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5099","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5170","text":"which provider supplied the spatial enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-5098","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5101","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5171","text":"which operation was called"}]}],"id":"blk-5100","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5103","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5172","text":"which input led to the spatial result"}]}],"id":"blk-5102","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5105","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5173","text":"what downstream reasoning consumed that result"}]}],"id":"blk-5104","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5106","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5174","text":"That is important for questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-5107","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5109","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5175","text":"Why did the agent choose "},{"id":"spn-5176","marks":["code"],"text":"us-east"},{"id":"spn-5177","text":" over "},{"id":"spn-5178","marks":["code"],"text":"us-central"},{"id":"spn-5179","text":"?"}]}],"id":"blk-5108","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5111","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5180","text":"Why did the system reject this route?"}]}],"id":"blk-5110","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5113","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5181","text":"Which geofence triggered escalation?"}]}],"id":"blk-5112","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5115","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5182","text":"Which provider determined regional capacity?"}]}],"id":"blk-5114","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5116","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5183","text":"Spatial claims can have major operational consequences, so they should be auditable."}]},{"id":"blk-5117","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5184","text":"Design patterns for "},{"id":"spn-5185","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"}]},{"id":"blk-5118","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5186","text":"Pattern 1: Spatial enrichment before reasoning"}]},{"id":"blk-5119","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5187","text":"Good when the decision depends on location-aware context."}]},{"id":"blk-5120","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5188","text":"Example: detect first, localize second, reason third."}]},{"id":"blk-5121","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5189","text":"Pattern 2: Boundary validation before execution"}]},{"id":"blk-5122","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5190","text":"Good for compliance and operational safety."}]},{"id":"blk-5123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5191","text":"Example: check geofence or route legality before the planner or executor commits an action."}]},{"id":"blk-5124","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5192","text":"Pattern 3: Region-aware memory lookup"}]},{"id":"blk-5125","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5193","text":"Good when similarity depends on both event type and location."}]},{"id":"blk-5126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5194","text":"Example: retrieve prior incidents from the same facility type, same region class, or same route family."}]},{"id":"blk-5127","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5195","text":"Pattern 4: Spatial fallback routing"}]},{"id":"blk-5128","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5196","text":"Good when a preferred route or region becomes invalid."}]},{"id":"blk-5129","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5197","text":"Example: route planner requests an alternative region or path under governance constraints."}]},{"id":"blk-5130","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5198","text":"Anti-patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-5131","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5199","text":"Anti-pattern 1: Treating space as just metadata"}]},{"id":"blk-5132","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5200","text":"If location meaningfully changes action, "},{"id":"spn-5201","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5202","text":" should be modeled explicitly, not buried in arbitrary JSON fields."}]},{"id":"blk-5133","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5203","text":"Anti-pattern 2: Collapsing all spatial problems into one provider call"}]},{"id":"blk-5134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5204","text":"Route planning, geofencing, and fleet-state enrichment are related but not identical. Subtypes exist to keep those concerns distinct."}]},{"id":"blk-5135","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5205","text":"Anti-pattern 3: Letting reasoners infer geography from raw text alone"}]},{"id":"blk-5136","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5206","text":"A reasoner may be excellent at explanation and still be a poor source of authoritative spatial state."}]},{"id":"blk-5137","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5207","text":"Anti-pattern 4: Ignoring provenance for location-sensitive decisions"}]},{"id":"blk-5138","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5208","text":"Spatial decisions without lineage are hard to debug and risky to audit."}]},{"id":"blk-5139","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5209","text":"How "},{"id":"spn-5210","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5211","text":" should evolve"}]},{"id":"blk-5140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5212","text":"The protocol should keep "},{"id":"spn-5213","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5214","text":" simple at the primitive level and expressive at the subtype and contract level."}]},{"id":"blk-5141","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5215","text":"That suggests a few healthy directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-5142","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5144","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5216","text":"preserve "},{"id":"spn-5217","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5218","text":" as a stable top-level primitive"}]}],"id":"blk-5143","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5146","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5219","text":"allow subtypes to evolve as use cases become clearer"}]}],"id":"blk-5145","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5148","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5220","text":"keep providers separate from capabilities"}]}],"id":"blk-5147","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5150","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5221","text":"encourage typed contracts instead of loose \"map\" outputs"}]}],"id":"blk-5149","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5222","text":"expand examples and registry entries only when grounded in real use cases"}]}],"id":"blk-5151","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5223","text":"A good "},{"id":"spn-5224","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5225","text":" ecosystem is not one with the most subtype names. It is one where spatial capability is explicit, composable, and trustworthy."}]},{"id":"blk-5154","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5226","text":"Practical examples in this repository"}]},{"id":"blk-5155","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5227","text":"The protocol repository already points toward several spatially relevant examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-5156","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5228","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-5229","text":" in infrastructure and fleet-oriented declarations"}]}],"id":"blk-5157","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5160","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5230","text":"provider patterns such as "},{"id":"spn-5231","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic"}]}],"id":"blk-5159","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5232","text":"composition with "},{"id":"spn-5233","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-5234","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-5235","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-5161","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5236","text":"As the docs hub expands, useful next additions would include:"}]},{"id":"blk-5164","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5237","text":"a route-planning example declaration"}]}],"id":"blk-5165","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5238","text":"a geofence/compliance example"}]}],"id":"blk-5167","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5239","text":"a contract artifact for "},{"id":"spn-5240","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]}],"id":"blk-5169","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5241","text":"registry entries for additional spatial providers"}]}],"id":"blk-5171","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5242","text":"diagrams showing "},{"id":"spn-5243","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5244","text":" composition with time and reason"}]}],"id":"blk-5173","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5175","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-5245","text":"Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-5176","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5246","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5247","text":" is the protocol's answer to the question:"}]},{"id":"blk-5177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5248","marks":["bold"],"text":"How does an agent represent and reason about where things are?"}]},{"id":"blk-5178","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5249","text":"It matters because many real agent systems are not purely textual or purely symbolic. They are situated."}]},{"id":"blk-5179","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5250","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5251","text":" makes spatial intelligence:"}]},{"id":"blk-5180","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5182","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5252","text":"explicit in the declaration"}]}],"id":"blk-5181","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5184","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5253","text":"separable from providers"}]}],"id":"blk-5183","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5186","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5254","text":"contract-aware"}]}],"id":"blk-5185","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5188","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5255","text":"composable with memory, time, and reason"}]}],"id":"blk-5187","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5190","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5256","text":"governable"}]}],"id":"blk-5189","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5257","text":"provenance-aware"}]}],"id":"blk-5191","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-5194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5258","text":"compilable into downstream agent artifacts"}]}],"id":"blk-5193","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-5195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5259","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-5260","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-5261","text":" helps the agent remember, and "},{"id":"spn-5262","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-5263","text":" helps it decide, and "},{"id":"spn-5264","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-5265","text":" helps it understand change,"}]},{"id":"blk-5196","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-5266","text":"then "},{"id":"spn-5267","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-5268","text":" helps it stay grounded in the world the decision actually affects."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierah2uv5hlktxrsd7pz5vcqj76klr57n743jpo57pbcnsj32mbae4xa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}